{"seq":1,"slug":"interpretable-ai","title":"研究生 智能系统 — 可解释人工智能","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/intelligent-systems/trustworthy-ai/interpretable-ai","wordCount":2340,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-智能系统-可解释人工智能\">研究生 智能系统 — 可解释人工智能</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>可解释人工智能（Explainable AI, XAI）致力于让 AI 系统的决策过程对人类可理解。当深度学习模型在医疗诊断、司法判决和金融风控等高风险场景中使用时，&quot;模型为什么做出这个预测？&quot;不再只是学术问题，而是法律和伦理的硬性要求。欧盟 GDPR 的&quot;解释权&quot;条款明确要求自动化决策系统必须提供有意义的解释。</p>\n<p>可解释性方法的分类体系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>分类</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时机</td>\n<td>事前（Ante-hoc）vs. 事后（Post-hoc）</td>\n<td>设计时内建 vs. 训练后解释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围</td>\n<td>全局（Global）vs. 局部（Local）</td>\n<td>解释整体模型行为 vs. 单个预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型依赖性</td>\n<td>模型无关（Model-agnostic）vs. 模型特定</td>\n<td>适用任何模型 vs. 特定架构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解释形式</td>\n<td>特征归因 / 规则 / 样例 / 概念</td>\n<td>不同的表示方式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>可解释性与准确性之间并非零和博弈。虽然简单的线性模型天然可解释，但现代 XAI 技术使得复杂模型也能提供高质量的解释——关键在于选择正确的解释方法和恰当的粒度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"特征归因方法\">特征归因方法</h3><p>特征归因（Feature Attribution）为每个输入特征分配一个重要性分数，回答&quot;哪些特征对这个预测贡献最大？&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>LIME（Local Interpretable Model-agnostic Explanations）</strong> 在单个预测的局部邻域中拟合一个可解释的代理模型（如线性回归）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>对输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 生成扰动样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{x&#x27;_i\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0106em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>（如随机遮挡图像区域或移除文本 token）</li>\n<li>用原始模型对扰动样本打分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x&#x27;_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0106em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>用加权线性模型拟合：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(z) = w^T z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span>，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 即为特征重要性</li>\n</ol>\n<p>LIME 的问题在于解释的不稳定性——相同的输入在不同运行中可能得到不同的解释，因为扰动和拟合过程都有随机性。</p>\n<p><strong>SHAP（SHapley Additive exPlanations）</strong> 基于合作博弈论中的 Shapley 值，为特征归因提供了唯一满足四个公理性质（效率性、对称性、虚拟性、可加性）的方案。特征 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的 Shapley 值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>∖</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_i(f, x) = \\sum_{S \\subseteq N \\setminus \\{i\\}} \\frac{|S|!(|N|-|S|-1)!}{|N|!} \\left[f_{S \\cup \\{i\\}}(x) - f_S(x)\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.943em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">⊆</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∖</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)!</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∪</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_S(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是只使用特征子集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 时的模型预测（其余特征边际化）。精确计算 SHAP 值需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 次模型评估，实际使用近似方法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>KernelSHAP</strong>：模型无关，用加权最小二乘回归近似 Shapley 值</li>\n<li><strong>TreeSHAP</strong>：树模型特定，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(TLD)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 精确计算（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 为树数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为叶子数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为深度）</li>\n<li><strong>DeepSHAP</strong>：结合 DeepLIFT 的反向传播归因和 Shapley 值的加权</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[特征归因方法] --&gt; B[梯度类]&#10;    A --&gt; C[扰动类]&#10;    A --&gt; D[博弈论类]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Saliency Map]&#10;    B --&gt; F[Integrated Gradients]&#10;    B --&gt; G[GradCAM]&#10;    C --&gt; H[LIME]&#10;    C --&gt; I[Occlusion]&#10;    D --&gt; J[SHAP]&#10;    D --&gt; K[Shapley Flow]\">graph TD\n    A[特征归因方法] --&gt; B[梯度类]\n    A --&gt; C[扰动类]\n    A --&gt; D[博弈论类]\n    B --&gt; E[Saliency Map]\n    B --&gt; F[Integrated Gradients]\n    B --&gt; G[GradCAM]\n    C --&gt; H[LIME]\n    C --&gt; I[Occlusion]\n    D --&gt; J[SHAP]\n    D --&gt; K[Shapley Flow]</pre><p><strong>Integrated Gradients（IG）</strong> 沿着从基线输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（如全零图像）到实际输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的路径积分梯度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>IG</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{IG}_i(x) = (x_i - x&#x27;_i) \\times \\int_0^1 \\frac{\\partial f(x&#x27; + \\alpha(x - x&#x27;))}{\\partial x_i} d\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IG</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.476em;vertical-align:-0.9119em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.564em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4289em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>IG 满足两个重要公理：完整性（所有特征归因之和等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x) - f(x&#x27;)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）和敏感性（如果特征改变导致输出改变，该特征的归因非零）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"注意力可视化与机制可解释性\">注意力可视化与机制可解释性</h3><p>对于 Transformer 模型，注意力权重提供了一种自然的&quot;解释&quot;——但注意力是否真正反映了模型的推理过程仍有争议。</p>\n<p><strong>注意力 ≠ 解释</strong>：Jain 和 Wallace（2019）证明注意力权重可以被大幅扰动而不改变模型输出——说明注意力可能不是因果性的解释。Wiegreffe 和 Pinter（2019）则反驳指出，对于某些任务，注意力确实编码了有意义的信息。</p>\n<p><strong>机制可解释性（Mechanistic Interpretability）</strong> 试图理解模型的内部计算机制，而非仅提供输入-输出层面的解释。Anthropic 的 Transformer Circuits 工作发现了：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>归纳头（Induction Heads）</strong>：两层注意力模式实现 [A][B]...[A] → [B] 的上下文拷贝</li>\n<li><strong>特征叠加（Superposition）</strong>：模型在低维残差流中编码了远多于维度数的特征，通过稀疏激活实现&quot;压缩存储&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>稀疏自编码器（SAE）</strong>：用稀疏字典学习从残差流中提取可解释的特征方向</li>\n</ul>\n<p>机制可解释性的长期目标是完全理解模型的&quot;算法&quot;——不只是&quot;哪个特征重要&quot;，而是&quot;模型用什么计算步骤得出结论&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"概念基础的解释\">概念基础的解释</h3><p>特征级解释（像素、token）往往过于低层——用户更关心高层概念。概念基础方法将解释提升到人类可理解的概念层面。</p>\n<p><strong>TCAV（Testing with Concept Activation Vectors）</strong> 定义一个概念（如&quot;条纹&quot;）的激活向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——在模型内部表示空间中，区分&quot;有条纹&quot;和&quot;无条纹&quot;图像的方向。然后测量概念对预测的影响：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{c,k} = \\frac{|\\{x \\in X_k : \\nabla h_l(x) \\cdot v_c &gt; 0\\}|}{|X_k|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这回答了&quot;&#39;条纹&#39;概念在多大程度上支持了&#39;斑马&#39;的预测？&quot;——比&quot;第 (128, 256) 个像素重要&quot;有意义得多。</p>\n<p><strong>Concept Bottleneck Models（CBM）</strong> 将概念解释内建到模型架构中：模型先预测中间概念层（如&quot;翅膀颜色=红色&quot;、&quot;喙形状=尖&quot;），再基于概念进行最终分类。概念层是人类可检查和可干预的——如果模型的概念判断错误，人类可以纠正概念值并观察分类结果的变化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"评估可解释性\">评估可解释性</h3><p>可解释性的评估是该领域最困难的问题之一——什么才算&quot;好的&quot;解释？</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评估维度</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>忠实性（Faithfulness）</td>\n<td>删除/插入实验：移除重要特征后性能下降幅度</td>\n<td>依赖移除策略（置零/模糊/采样）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定性（Stability）</td>\n<td>相似输入的解释是否一致</td>\n<td>相似性度量的选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人类评估</td>\n<td>用户研究：解释是否帮助人类预测模型行为</td>\n<td>昂贵、主观、不可复现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可操作性</td>\n<td>解释是否帮助用户改善决策</td>\n<td>任务依赖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>删除实验</strong>是最常用的自动化忠实性评估。按重要性排序逐一移除特征，记录模型性能的下降曲线（AUC）。好的归因方法应该使性能快速下降。但&quot;移除&quot;操作本身的定义（置零、使用均值替代、用数据分布采样）会影响结果，没有统一的标准。</p>\n<h3 id=\"可解释性与法规\">可解释性与法规</h3><p>GDPR 第 22 条赋予数据主体&quot;不受仅基于自动化处理的决定的约束&quot;的权利，但&quot;有意义的解释&quot;的具体要求仍在法律解释中演进。</p>\n<p>可解释性的实践层级：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>透明性（Transparency）</strong>：公开系统使用了 AI 做决策</li>\n<li><strong>可理解性（Comprehensibility）</strong>：提供非技术人员可理解的决策因素</li>\n<li><strong>可追溯性（Traceability）</strong>：记录数据、模型版本和决策过程的完整审计链</li>\n<li><strong>可争议性（Contestability）</strong>：为不服决策的个人提供申诉机制</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>在 MNIST 分类模型上实现 LIME 和 Integrated Gradients。对同一预测，比较两种方法给出的像素重要性图。哪种方法的解释更稳定？运行 10 次 LIME，计算解释的方差。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>在表格数据（如 UCI Adult 数据集的收入预测）上实现 SHAP。分析全局特征重要性（SHAP summary plot）和单个预测的局部解释。是否存在模型依赖的&quot;不公平&quot;特征（如种族、性别）被赋予高重要性的情况？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>加载预训练的 BERT 模型，对情感分类任务提取注意力权重。手动检查 10 个样本的注意力模式——注意力是否集中在情感相关的词上？通过随机打乱注意力权重测试输出变化，评估注意力的忠实性。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个用户研究：给两组参与者看同样的 AI 预测，一组附带 SHAP 解释，一组不附带。要求两组判断预测是否正确。比较有无解释时人类判断的准确率和信心。讨论解释是否可能导致过度信任。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Molnar, <em>Interpretable Machine Learning</em> — 免费在线书籍，覆盖所有主流 XAI 方法（定期更新）</li>\n<li>Lundberg &amp; Lee (2017), <em>A Unified Approach to Interpreting Model Predictions</em> — SHAP 的原始论文</li>\n<li>Sundararajan 等 (2017), <em>Axiomatic Attribution for Deep Networks</em> — Integrated Gradients 的原始论文</li>\n<li>Elhage 等 (2022), <em>Toy Models of Superposition</em> — Anthropic 对特征叠加现象的深入分析</li>\n<li>Kim 等 (2018), <em>Interpretability Beyond Feature Attribution: Quantitative Testing with Concept Activation Vectors</em> — TCAV 论文</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>可解释人工智能处于技术能力与社会需求的交汇点。特征归因方法（SHAP、Integrated Gradients）提供了数学上严格的局部解释框架，概念基础方法（TCAV、CBM）将解释提升到人类可理解的抽象层面，机制可解释性则追求对模型内部计算的完整理解。评估可解释性本身是一个深层困难——忠实性、稳定性和人类可理解性之间的平衡尚无定论。随着 AI 系统在高风险领域的广泛部署，可解释性不再是学术锦上添花，而是负责任的 AI 开发的核心要求。理解不同解释方法的数学基础、适用范围和局限性，是构建可信赖 AI 系统的必要素养。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 智能系统 — 可解释人工智能","id":"研究生-智能系统-可解释人工智能"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"特征归因方法","id":"特征归因方法"},{"level":3,"text":"注意力可视化与机制可解释性","id":"注意力可视化与机制可解释性"},{"level":3,"text":"概念基础的解释","id":"概念基础的解释"},{"level":3,"text":"评估可解释性","id":"评估可解释性"},{"level":3,"text":"可解释性与法规","id":"可解释性与法规"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 智能系统 — 机器人学习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/intelligent-systems/autonomous-systems/robot-learning"},"next":{"title":"研究生 智能系统 — 机器学习公平性","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/intelligent-systems/trustworthy-ai/fairness-in-ml"}}